\ m\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}-7\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ m\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-15 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $m=-5.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186314967 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "33586620-e110-5a37-874f-a92103c5e9fb" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for One Coefficient in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "741fb66b-3c95-5e3f-97d8-1d622c179c77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312899} {:answer/id #uuid "a00e943c-dce5-5328-838e-67cbbde69469" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313234} {:answer/id #uuid "bcfd1363-2dc4-5697-89d7-e836d86cd1f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313451} {:answer/id #uuid "e1471d01-84a3-5d08-a011-92c14092e267" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313749} {:answer/id #uuid "ecb77f81-e06a-53ad-9d1f-4be8c7d1e7ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313865}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a00e943c-dce5-5328-838e-67cbbde69469" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313234} :answer-field/id #uuid "f015a2f9-b1d2-5717-a774-3e1dd65acf95" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314670}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "3910d8c3-7517-5b80-9efc-a8b60965d481" :question/math-academy-id "q-34051" :question/problem "Find $k$, if $2{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $k$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+k\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ k\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ k\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $k=-3.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186317257 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "33586620-e110-5a37-874f-a92103c5e9fb" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for One Coefficient in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "33982a47-2adf-5799-8859-c34bed20a404" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315422} {:answer/id #uuid "5687a31f-ebd2-5317-b3f8-3e2eae8a8565" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315615} {:answer/id #uuid "93d32481-f69e-5005-9fba-39aac45998ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315942} {:answer/id #uuid "e65cf7c4-b06f-5fb6-ae22-a85e9d62118e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316393} {:answer/id #uuid "fd275a29-c2ad-592a-9be5-c71e7051b5cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316533}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5687a31f-ebd2-5317-b3f8-3e2eae8a8565" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315615} :answer-field/id #uuid "7b6e91e2-8f56-510a-b9e8-f88a07dd